cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Lymphix
message: >-
  If you use Lymphix in published work, please cite the underlying tools
  (TRUST4 and IgBLAST) as well as this software.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Trethewey
    given-names: "C. S."
repository-code: "https://github.com/Trethewey/lymphix"
url: "https://github.com/Trethewey/lymphix"
abstract: >-
  Lymphix is a Nextflow pipeline for BCR / TCR clonality and V(D)J
  rearrangement calling from 2x150bp Illumina DNA capture NGS. Supports plain
  Illumina libraries, TWIST UMI chemistry, and IDT xGen UMI-UDI duplex UMIs.
  Wraps TRUST4 (V(D)J assembly) and IgBLAST (re-annotation with V-identity %
  for IGHV CLL classification), and computes per-locus clonality metrics,
  lineage composition, kappa/lambda restriction, and an HTML report.
keywords:
  - immune repertoire
  - BCR
  - TCR
  - V(D)J
  - clonality
  - lymphoma
  - CLL
  - Nextflow
  - DNAnexus
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-13"
